Package: gsim
Type: Package
Title: Genomic Simulation for Validation Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Sørensen", email = "peter.sorensen@r-qgg.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulates genotype and phenotype data for genomic validation
    studies. Supports independent simulated genotypes, caller-provided genotype
    matrices, and optional qgg genotype-list objects, with scalar or multiple
    traits, annotation-informed architectures, marker-specific effect-variance
    multipliers, and optional summary statistics.
License: GPL-3
Suggests:
    qgg,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
